   "source": [
    "# Install FLOVOPY\n",
    "\n",
    "If you already have an old version of the environment installed, do this first:\n",
    "\n",
    "```\n",
    "conda remove --name flovopy_env --all\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "Then please follow the instructions at https://github.com/gthompson/flovopy/ to clone and install FLOVOPY."
   ]
  }
